&#39; characters are not <br>needed in the model syntax. If you need more than 1 formula on the same <br>line, you can use &quot;;&quot; as in<br><br>mod.B &lt;- &#39;f1 =~ v1 + v2 + v3; f2 =~ v4 + v5 + v6; f3 =~ v7 + v8 + v9&#39;<br><br>Also note: single quotes for surrounding the model syntax are preferred.<br><br>As for Model D: the f1 ~~ 0*f2 + 0*f3
